<title>USA: Clinton meets with King Hussein of Jordan.</title>
<headline>Clinton meets with King Hussein of Jordan.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton, searching for ways to defuse the latest tensions between Israelis and Palestinians, met at the White House on Monday night on the eve of an emergency Mideast summit.</p>
<p>Clinton met with King Hussein a short time after he arrived in the United States. Both men on Tuesday were to participate in a summit with Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu and Palestinian President Yassir Arafat.</p>
